Type:     comm/bbs
Version:  1.05
Requires: OS 2.04 or better
8.3 name: cP!-HBu5.LHA

  Introduction
  ============

    This contents of this archive will update a working installation of
    HydraBBS V1.04 to V1.05.

    This release updates the protocol doors to check if a user
    on another node is uploading the same file.

    Also it fixes the problem (hopefully!) of the new user door stopping
    and the account editor not finding the new user.

    It also adds a MakeFreeDL door.

